@startuml
title 智颐养老系统 - 动态数据源切换机制

skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor #FFF8F0
  BorderColor #D2691E
  FontSize 11
  RoundCorner 8
}

rectangle "DruidConfig" as config #FFE4E1
rectangle "DruidProperties" as props

rectangle "masterDataSource" as master
rectangle "slaveDataSource\n(条件:enabled=true)" as slave

rectangle "DynamicDataSource\n(扩展AbstractRoutingDataSource)" as dynamic #FFFACD {
  rectangle "determineCurrentLookupKey()" as lookup
}

rectangle "DynamicDataSource\nContextHolder" as holder #F0FFF0 {
  rectangle "ThreadLocal<String>\nsetDataSourceType()" as setDS
  rectangle "getDataSourceType()" as getDS
  rectangle "clearDataSourceType()" as clearDS
}

rectangle "DataSourceAspect\n@Aspect @Order(1)" as aspect #FFE4E1

rectangle "业务层\n@Service/@Repository" as biz

rectangle "MySQL主库\n(写)" as masterDb
rectangle "MySQL从库\n(读)" as slaveDb

config --> props : 读取配置
props --> master : spring.datasource.druid.master.*
props --> slave : spring.datasource.druid.slave.*

master --> dynamic : 注册为目标数据源
slave --> dynamic : 注册为目标数据源

dynamic --> lookup : 选择数据源

holder --> dynamic : 提供当前Key
aspect <.. holder : 设置/清理

aspect --> biz : 环绕通知

note right of aspect
  @DataSource(DataSourceType.SLAVE)
  public List<User> list() {
    // 查询走从库
  }
  
  或类级别:
  @DataSource(DataSourceType.MASTER)
  @Service
  public class UserServiceImpl
end note

note right of holder
  ThreadLocal实现
  避免线程安全问题
  每次请求独立上下文
  用完后必须清理
end note

biz --> dynamic : 注入
dynamic --> masterDb : 写操作
dynamic --> slaveDb : 读操作

note bottom of aspect
  执行流程:
  1. @Around拦截
  2. 解析@DataSource注解
  3. 设置DS到ThreadLocal
  4. proceed()执行业务
  5. finally清除DS
end note

@enduml
